# Upload filter for CLI deployments of the cloud project (repo root is the
# deployment root, see vercel.json). The server and migrate services compile
# the Go binary from this tree with Vercel's Go preset (apps/cloud/build.sh
# writes the stub UI embeds itself), the UI services build with moon, so Go
# sources and every moon project source (tools/) stay in. Only repo meta and
# build artifacts are dropped.
# Entries use gitignore syntax: anchor directories with a leading slash, or
# `docs` would also drop `apps/docs`.
/docs
/examples
/skills
/.github
dist
.next
.vercel
test-output
*.tsbuildinfo
/apps/docs/.source
/apps/docs/.generated
/apps/storybook/out
/apps/console/out
/apps/login-ui/out
